<title>SPAIN: Spain March M4 rose provisional 2.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain March M4 rose provisional 2.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the</p>
<p>following figures:</p>
<p> MONEY SUPPLY		    MAR 97     FEB 97     MAR 96</p>
<p> M4 pct rise			2.3	 -1.3	  10.5</p>
<p> Domestic credit pct rise     8.2	 17.7	  7.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Percentage monthly rises are on annualised basis. Revised figures for previous months will follow later.</p>
</text>
